      "difficulty": "简单",
      "type": "独立编写",
      "title": "原始类别统一大写",
      "context": "类别字段的大小写和空格不统一，要规范成大写再统计。",
      "requirements": "输出 raw_data 的 id 和规范化后的类别 normalized_category：去掉两端空格后转成英文大写，NULL 保持 NULL。\n输出列名称及顺序：id, normalized_category。",
      "datasetId": "q0154-lesson",
      "schemaVersion": 3,
      "contentVersion": "3.0.0",
      "sourceTables": [
        "raw_data"
      ],
      "initialCode": "",
      "options": [],
      "acceptedBlanks": [],
      "expectedOutput": {
        "kind": "query",
        "columns": [
          "id",
          "normalized_category"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            1,
            "SKIN"
          ],
          [
            2,
            "SKIN"
          ],
          [
            3,
            "SKIN"
          ],
          [
            4,
            "HOME"
          ],
          [
            5,
            "MAKEUP"
          ],
          [
            6,
            "HOME"
          ]
        ],
        "rowCount": 6
      },
      "referenceSolutions": [
        {
          "kind": "reference",
          "mysqlSql": "SELECT id,UPPER(TRIM(category)) AS normalized_category FROM raw_data",
          "sqliteSql": "SELECT id,UPPER(TRIM(category)) AS normalized_category FROM raw_data"
        },
        {
          "kind": "代数或函数等价",
          "mysqlSql": "SELECT id,TRIM(UPPER(category)) AS normalized_category FROM raw_data",
          "sqliteSql": "SELECT id,TRIM(UPPER(category)) AS normalized_category FROM raw_data"
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        "两步处理：先去空格，再转大小写。",
        "TRIM 去掉两端空格，UPPER 转大写，函数可以嵌套使用。",
        "注意转换方向是大写，不是小写。"
      ],
      "explanation": "UPPER(TRIM(category))：先 TRIM 再 UPPER，NULL 经过两个函数仍是 NULL。\n易错：用 LOWER 得到的是小写。",
      "commonErrors": [
        {
          "sql": "SELECT id,LOWER(TRIM(category)) AS normalized_category FROM raw_data",
          "reason": "LOWER 转成了小写，题目要求大写。",
          "validation": "典型错误已在至少一组夹具被结果/状态比对拒绝"
